   :note    "黒コート＋紫の裏地が正しく出た版。年齢は 16-17 相当で出るが 兄貴分としては許容。蛇は肩に乗らず別カットに出やすい"
   :prompt  "14 year old boy, cool teenage hacker, dark charcoal almost black short hair with long bangs falling over one eye, light violet eyes, wearing a BLACK long coat draped over both shoulders like a cape with empty sleeves, the inside lining of the coat is bright violet, plain black t-shirt and dark cargo pants underneath, a small slender white snake resting across his shoulders, confident smirk, shonen manga character design sheet, front and back view, plain white background, clean anime linework, cel shading"}

  {:id      :howl
   :name    "ハウル（四牙）"
   :status  :approved
   :note    "高い立ち襟の黒ロングコート・後ろで結んだ銀髪・黄の目・喉のチョーカーが全部出た版。menace は弱めだが 7+ 側に倒してある。'sinister/unsettling' を入れるとホラー顔になるので入れない"
   :prompt  "young adult man wearing a long BLACK coat reaching his ankles, buttoned closed, with a very high stand up collar that covers his jaw, black gloves, silver white long hair tied back in a low ponytail, yellow eyes with dark circles beneath, a plain black choker visible at his throat, calm thin smile, shonen manga villain character design sheet, front full body view, plain white background, clean anime linework, cel shading"}

