   :note    "まんまる＋ライムのくちばしと足＋半目の無表情。表情差分シートで出る。狙いどおり"
   :prompt  "a very round chubby cute white dove with small bright lime green feet and beak, unusually intelligent deadpan half lidded eyes, sitting still, tiny wings, mascot character design sheet with several expressions, plain white background, clean anime linework, cel shading, kawaii"}

  {:id      :proc
