   :prompt  "an extremely fluffy round white sheep mascot, soft mochi like cloud shaped wool, tiny hooves, calm gentle teal blue eyes, hug pillow sized, sitting, mascot character design sheet with several expressions, plain white background, clean anime linework, cel shading, kawaii"}

  {:id      :stealth
